  "description": "Lee Su-Hyeok who luckily got couple travel tickets for Paris, leaves for the journey with excitement. However right after he arrives, he gets robbed. Fortunately, thanks to the detective Kang who is his match partner, he gets out of the trouble.\n\nJust like that their tour begins, and Su-Hyeok is excited to be travelling with a partner who's exactly his type and enjoys the tour, but detective Kang doesn't seem to be in a good mood the whole day.\n\nAnd on their first night, somehow Su-Hyeok's wrists get locked to the bed...\n\n*'What the heck... Someone please explain this to me-!!'*\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
